    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66e1fd2b06c346fca95f54b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一边收集西沙里奥方方面面的数据，\n一边与她共度各种时光――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c91f07b64da03f693bda6d798d7ad980342812d93b8a727d6dd928f755db0fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe396d03096cc009c7109e54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼此理解，也被彼此理解，\n这样忙碌得令人目不暇接的日子。\n已经持续了半年，某一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f525e98a7a9d280e197f65e8e936f3d3c96762173c0cc778b2c434e9f623199",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
