    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c595866b886d20e101bdd50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但那孩子这股本能似乎尤其强烈。\n前些天还从训练场溜出去\n跑到了很远的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b01ed4c9be1c53b60629b7c97f5d2f33c76d321e4c53f5d2f2605050cfbbfc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
