      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回来吧，要不要和老师在训练场一起跑？\n在草地上跑很有趣哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d924414f46b889256d2f93129198df352b39bf72c3fd7ad345650454e26439f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
