    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2990150c9bfadbad5adfbf5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想，身为赛马娘训练员的您\n或许知道突破口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ffd612095475aedc83f61b60e134f76b6de9a8bba68c2d1c0176d3bb77187c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df2892782c8a975d387365d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想着如果能帮上忙，\n我决定先观察一下那孩子的情况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "074f2013bd7e35e8f3eb49dd457dbb8ed31b2b3c9b017bfab2d953b46e8264e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32333755adb5fd233cf4f8e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她会反抗制止的话，\n还会伺机溜出去……\n的确，我能理解那份焦急。",
      "source_fingerprint": "807e6f04169b72b10e3de749ecd55f5546f4c94ed540befee0503ae517291e13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f117fe8d95e0922ad068dc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，看那样子明显是\n故意不听――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ac382f28eb38b9daf4bab69cb054b41150a5d292c6d354efa434b596557069c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
