      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a65b479820709a7315b4926a28df15640ca711c8bc3ff2482d9bebebe5dd4c38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70560850426bb3f7a14f0c11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先要培养信任，\n让她明白。我们站在她这一边，\n也真心盼她健康成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec05e072a80c3dbe0a5aa2aad22d2b4c57801ccda5e1ef029ad451252e681fa3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
